      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SIENNA BELLA (1) produced another strong performance last time when she battled on bravely to just miss out over 1800m at this track, adding to an impressive run of top-three results. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Steps up a level but she is up to the task. CLARENDEN NITRO (2) is a two-year-old gelding by Century Farroh from Lady Azalea on debut. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Capable of taking this out. WISHFUL DESIRE (5) lines up for the first time. By Bettors Wish and hails from the G M Howard stable. Has strong trial form coming into this. Has the right credentials to play a major role. SAL WESTER (4) cannot be left out after solid recent performances, the latest a sound second at Port Pirie over 1609m.",
